      },
      "skos:definition": "The critical and exploratory use of AI to develop or transform learning scenarios, pedagogical approaches, assessment, and student-centred learning while maintaining human-centred educational principles.",
      "gs:editorialStatus": "approved",
      "gs:activeDefinition": {
        "@id": "https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/ai-enhanced-pedagogical-innovation-1"
      },
      "gs:editorialExplanation": "At an advanced level, AI can become part of redesigning learning rather than merely automating existing activities, but innovation still requires human judgement and evidence.",
