      "rdf:value": "An IEEE recommended practice for ecosystem-scale systems that issue, hold, present, and exchange Learning and Employment Records (LERs) representing education, skills, employment, and related achievements using interoperable digital credentials and shared services.",
      "dcterms:language": "en",
      "dcterms:creator": {
