      "rdf:value": "An IEEE standard for interoperable augmented-reality learning systems. It defines a conceptual model for relationships among the physical world, the learner, digital information, learning activities, and the environment, along with data models and XML/JSON bindings for representing activities and context.",
      "dcterms:language": "en",
      "dcterms:creator": {
        "@id": "https://www.i2idl.org/"
