        "prov:Entity",
        "gs:Definition"
      ],
      "rdf:value": "The IEEE standard for the xAPI data model and RESTful web service used to communicate learner and human-performance experience data between activities and a Learning Record Store (LRS). It standardizes the JSON-based model and service behavior derived from xAPI 1.0.3.",
